# UI Components Guide

CogniLink Assistant uses React components for its UI, integrated into Obsidian's interface.

## Main Components
- [src/components/ChatView.tsx](mdc:src/components/ChatView.tsx)
  - Obsidian view container
  - Handles React integration
  - Manages view lifecycle
- [src/components/Chat.tsx](mdc:src/components/Chat.tsx)
  - Main chat interface
  - Message display and input
  - Handles message submission
  - Source display

## Styling
Global styles are defined in [styles.css](mdc:styles.css):
- Chat container layout
- Message bubbles
- Input area
- Source citations
- Timestamps

## Integration with Obsidian
The main plugin class in [src/main.ts](mdc:src/main.ts) handles:
- View registration
- Command registration
- Settings tab
- Ribbon icon

## Settings UI
Settings interface is managed by the CogniLinkSettingTab class in [src/main.ts](mdc:src/main.ts)
